Building Fibercoin

Use the autogen script to prepare the build environment.

    ./autogen.sh
    ./configure
    make

For development builds with tests enabled:

    make check

Always verify release checksums when downloading prebuilt binaries.

See the platform build documentation for additional requirements and current dependency information:

    doc/build-unix.md
    doc/build-osx.md
    doc/dependencies.md

The main Fibercoin binaries include:

    fibercoin-qt
    fibercoind
    fibercoin-cli
    fibercoin-tx
